    "_X5_note": "Core logic is the engine room. Everything else in the file exists to support it — SETUP declares what the engine needs, Constructors build it, Queries inspect it, Tests verify it. Core logic is what the file DOES. If this section is empty, the file has no purpose.",
    "_X5_scripture": "Ecclesiastes 9:10 — Whatsoever thy hand findeth to do, do it with thy might; for there is no work, nor device, nor knowledge, nor wisdom, in the grave, whither thou goest."
